      "pageTitle": "Joe Biden on X: &quot;I want to share a brief update. My presidential memoir, PROMISE ME, AMERICA, is coming out on November 17th. I hope you&#x27;ll read it. It covers my years as President. The challenges we faced, the decisions I made, a",
      "pageDescription": "I want to share a brief update.\n\nMy presidential memoir, PROMISE ME, AMERICA, is coming out on November 17th. I hope you&#x27;ll read it. It covers my years as President. The challenges we faced, the decisions I made, and why I made them. It&#x27;s about who we are as a nation. What we stand for. And America…",
      "evidenceText": "Joe Biden on X: \"I want to share a brief update. My presidential memoir, PROMISE ME, AMERICA, is coming out on November 17th. I hope you'll read it. It covers my years as President. The challenges we faced, the decisions I made, and why I made them. It's about who we are as a nation. What we stand… / X Post Log in Sign up Post Log in Sign up Joe Biden on X: \"I want to share a brief update. My presidential memoir, PROMISE ME, AMERICA, is coming out on November 17th. I hope you'll read it. It covers my years as President. The challenges we faced, the decisions I made, and why I made them. It's about who we are as a nation. What we stand for. And America's role in the world. More than anything, it's about my faith in the American people and the great American experiment in self-governance and democracy. While writing the book, I was diagnosed with cancer, a disease known all too well to millions of Americans and their families. My doctors continue to be encouraged by how I've responded to treatment. And the prayers and kind words and well wishes from so many of you have meant more to me and Jill and our family than you can ever know. Some days are better than others. It hasn't stopped me. But sometimes it slows me down. What that means is, unfortunately, I won’t be able to do as many conversations about my book as I’d hoped. However, I’m hopeful the words on the page speak for themselves. Looking forward, I'm going to keep following what my father told me a long time ago: \"Champ, when you get knocked down, get up.\" It's a good lesson for me. And for America. We are blessed. America is the most unique nation on earth. Unlike other countries, we're built on an idea. An idea bigger than any ocean. More powerful than any army. Stronger than any tyrant or dictator. That idea? All of us are created equal. Promise Me, America, we'll never forget it.\" Conversation Joe Biden @JoeBiden I want to share a brief update. My presidential memoir, PROMISE ME