      "id": "930aed8a921ed0859b2bf6a24a0a769e77e179c8ff8e651ee89b744ed68f3693",
      "title": "682: quantum of sollazzo",
      "url": "https://martinalderson.com/posts/how-the-ai-boom-might-really-end",
      "category": "uncategorized",
      "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T22:14:10.246Z",
